## General Style

- Clean SaaS-style interface
- White cards
- Slate borders
- Blue primary actions
- Subtle shadows
- Rounded corners
- Avoid excessive gradients
- Avoid excessive animations
- Use Lucide React icons
- Prefer Tailwind CSS
- Maintain responsive layouts